Infinitum Corporation® — VEIL browser proxy

This directory is original source written for Infinitum Corporation®.
No third-party VPN client, proxy implementation, or GPL-licensed code is
copied into the extension or the control server.

The extension calls the Chrome proxy API (chrome.proxy) and the Firefox
proxy API (browser.proxy). Those are browser platform interfaces, not
vendored source.

VEIL here protects traffic inside the browser that loaded the extension.
It is not a device-wide VPN, and this notice is not a grant of exit-node
capacity or a claim that any particular network path is private.
